89 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 53 0 R/T(Separate if statements are independent. When a condition is true, its block runs, and Python continues checking later if statements. If the conditions overlap, more than one block can execute. An if\205elif\205else chain tests alternatives in order and stops after the first true branch, so exactly one branch is selected.)/E(Separate if statements are independent. When a condition is true, its block runs, and Python continues checking later if statements. If the conditions overlap, more than one block can execute. An if\205elif\205else chain tests alternatives in order and stops after the first true branch, so exactly one branch is selected.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

