395 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 61 0 R/T(Let W\(n\) be the number of ways to climb n steps using 1-step or 2-step moves. The final move must come from either step n\2121 or step n\2122, so W\(n\) = W\(n\2121\) + W\(n\2122\). The base cases are W\(0\)=1 and W\(1\)=1. The supplied code uses `n <= 1` returning 1, which is equivalent for the requested nonnegative inputs.)/E(Let W\(n\) be the number of ways to climb n steps using 1-step or 2-step moves. The final move must come from either step n\2121 or step n\2122, so W\(n\) = W\(n\2121\) + W\(n\2122\). The base cases are W\(0\)=1 and W\(1\)=1. The supplied code uses `n <= 1` returning 1, which is equivalent for the requested nonnegative inputs.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

