510 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 64 0 R/T(The redesign uses dynamic programming with two rolling variables. At each iteration, the pair stores W\(k\2121\) and W\(k\). The next value is their sum. Only the last two values are needed, so older results can be discarded. The redesign exploits the recurrence\220s dependency on only two preceding states. No cache or recursive stack is required.)/E(The redesign uses dynamic programming with two rolling variables. At each iteration, the pair stores W\(k\2121\) and W\(k\). The next value is their sum. Only the last two values are needed, so older results can be discarded. The redesign exploits the recurrence\220s dependency on only two preceding states. No cache or recursive stack is required.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

