633 0 obj
<</Title(The naive recursive algorithm repeats the same subproblems. Each call for n greater than 1 launches two more calls, and the call tree expands rapidly. The measured call count for n=25 is 242,785, while memoisation needs only 26 function evaluations. The dominant cost is not the addition itself; it is repeated evaluation of identical W\(k\) values.)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 573 0 R>>
endobj

