636 0 obj
<</Title(Prediction: the iterative version will produce the same result as memoised recursion for every tested n, will complete n=1,000 without recursion-depth error, and will use O\(1\) auxiliary memory. It should be substantially faster than naive recursion for moderate and large n.)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 574 0 R>>
endobj

