864 0 obj
<</Title(Separate if statements are independent. When a condition is true, its block runs, and Python continues checking later if statements. If the conditions overlap, more than one block can execute. An if\205elif\205else chain tests alternatives in order and stops after the first true branch, so exactly one branch is selected.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 853 0 R>>
endobj

865 0 obj
<</Title(After the customer correctly answers the security question, the maximum number of counted OTP attempts becomes five; otherwise it remains three. The maximum can be set before entering the loop. Blank entries still do not increment the counter.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 856 0 R>>
endobj

866 0 obj
<</Title(2.4 Recursion and complexity)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 856 0 R/First 876 0 R/Last 876 0 R/Count -1/Next 877 0 R>>
endobj

