876 0 obj
<</Title(A recursive function could receive the remaining attempt count and call itself after a wrong nonblank entry. Each counted attempt performs O\(1\) work, so total time is O\(a\) for a attempts. A loop uses O\(1\) auxiliary space. Recursion uses O\(a\) call-stack space and is less suitable for a small bounded retry process. A counter updated before checking for a blank input can incorrectly consume attempts; a counter never updated after a wrong input can create an infinite loop.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 866 0 R>>
endobj

