925 0 obj
<</Title(Both slicing validation and a full-match regular expression take O\(L\) time for a string of length L. The slicing version explicitly shows each field and is easy for beginners to trace. A regular expression is compact and makes the overall format visible in one pattern, but may be less approachable to maintain when the reader is unfamiliar with regex syntax. The supplied task requires string methods for the primary implementation, so regex is only an alternative.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 908 0 R>>
endobj

926 0 obj
