945 0 obj
<</Title(Positional parameters are concise when the argument order is obvious, such as `add_item\("Tea", order\)`. Keyword parameters improve clarity when there are several options, such as `calculate_bill\(items, gst_rate=0.05\)`. Default parameters are suitable for optional values that are safe to share, such as immutable numbers or strings; mutable lists should generally use None. Python can return multiple values as a tuple.)/Dest[17 0 R/Fit]/Parent 931 0 R>>
endobj

